      "beat_id": "BIDEA",
      "act": "THE IDEA",
      "lane": "IDEA",
      "narration_text": "Here's the idea of this film. Everyone says a long CLAUDE.md gets ignored. I tried to make that happen — one rule, buried at line nine hundred twenty-five of a thousand-line file, six fresh sessions. It was obeyed every time. What a long file actually costs is tokens: every session reads all of it, before you've said a word. And it obeys the lines you forgot you wrote.",
